                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.22.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "22.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The royal line of David is like a tree that has been cut down; but just as new branches sprout from a stump, so a new king will arise from among David's descendants.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.15.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 15.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A day is coming when the new king from the royal line of David will be a symbol to the nations. They will gather in his royal city and give him honour. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When that day comes, the Lord will once again use his power and bring back home those of his people who are left in Assyria and Egypt, in the lands of Pathros, Ethiopia",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11.11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ethiopia",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ": See Word List.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", Elam, Babylonia, and Hamath, and in the coastlands and on the islands of the sea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " will raise a signal flag to show the nations that he is gathering together again the scattered people of Israel and Judah and bringing them back from the four corners of the earth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The kingdom of Israel will not be jealous of Judah any more, and Judah will not be the enemy of Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Together they will attack the Philistines on the west and plunder the people who live to the east. They will conquer the people of Edom and Moab, and the people of Ammon will obey them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.16.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rev 16.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " will dry up the Gulf of Suez, and he will bring a hot wind to dry up the Euphrates, leaving only seven tiny streams, so that anyone will be able to walk across. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There will be a highway out of Assyria for those of his people Israel who have survived there, just as there was for their ancestors when they left Egypt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
